permalink: /blog/
title: "Blog"
heroEyebrow: "Patient education"
heroTitle: "Blog"
heroSubtitle: "Clear, practical articles by Dr. Junaid Fateh on hair transplants, body contouring, skin treatments, reconstructive surgery and planning your procedure."
seo:
  title: "Blog | Dr. Junaid Fateh, Plastic Surgeon in Lahore"
